   "gap": "WealthMachine reads the staffing figures (WMI #45) but checks only the report's internal arithmetic: not the original problem, the certificate, the optimality or the world, so a consistent lie still reads as consistent (and is labelled unverified); each organ signs with its own key, yet WealthMachine holds DALEOBANKS's key to verify it (HMAC lets a verifier forge); the organs run pinned code on the body's host and UID, and the second WealthMachine process makes the assessment REPRODUCED (same-code determinism), not VERIFIED by an independent party"
